    "axis": "clarity",
    "evidence": "The headline, subtitle, 85%/100% comparison, explicit 0% gap definition, and deployment decision consistently communicate that this is a post-remediation regression—not an independent holdout or production-readiness proof. However, the screen does not provide a clear next action for obtaining the required independent holdout; “Hide scope evidence” only toggles the decorative/evidence panel. Dense jargon, very small metadata, and the oversized low-information vault graphic weaken scanability, especially on mobile.",
